<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
	<key>items</key>
	<array>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>温控锁定CPU频率值</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>由于无法从硬件中读取到真实的CPU最大频率，所以频率需要自己输入，然后重启用户空间、或者重新安装一下插件即可生效。（不建议过小以及过大，按照CPU合理范围填写就行，否则可能存在隐患。）</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSEditTextCell</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<string></string>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>com.huayuarc.cputhermal-prefs</string>
			<key>keyboard</key>
			<string>numbers</string>
			<key>isURL</key>
			<string>false</string>
			<key>isNumeric</key>
			<string>true</string>
			<key>isIP</key>
			<string>true</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>cpuMinPowerValue</string>
			<key>placeholder</key>
			<string>仅支持数字，否则不生效。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>降低频率（模拟）</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>我也不知道这个功能有什么用，但要就支持一下吧。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSegmentCell</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<string>nominal</string>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>com.huayuarc.cputhermal-prefs</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>thermalPuppetValue</string>
			<key>validValues</key>
			<array>
				<string>nominal</string>
				<string>light</string>
				<string>moderate</string>
				<string>heavy</string>
			</array>
			<key>validTitles</key>
			<array>
				<string>无</string>
				<string>轻微</string>
				<string>中度</string>
				<string>重度</string>
			</array>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>屏幕控制</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>开启后阻止系统因温控主动调暗屏幕亮度，保持当前亮度不变。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSwitchCell</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<true/>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>com.huayuarc.cputhermal-prefs</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>thermalPreventDimmingEnabled</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>防温控暗屏</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>CPU 模式</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>防止温控降频：阻止 thermalmonitord 下发降频动作，保持 CPU 全性能运行。模拟低电频率：模拟中度热压力触发系统主动降频，节电但性能下降。两者不宜同时开启。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSwitchCell</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<true/>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>com.huayuarc.cputhermal-prefs</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>thermalFullPowerEnabled</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>防止温控降频</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSwitchCell</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<false/>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>com.huayuarc.cputhermal-prefs</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>thermalLowPowerEnabled</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>模拟低电频率</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>系统工具</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>重启用户空间将继续使用当前系统版本，无需重新越狱。此操作会强制关闭所有应用并重新加载系统环境。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSButtonCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>重启用户空间</string>
			<key>action</key>
			<string>userspaceRebootTapped</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>https://github.com/be-huge/insulation</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>开源代码</string>
		</dict>
	</array>
	<key>title</key>
	<string>CPU 去温控</string>
</dict>
</plist>
